<title>USA: PacifiCare to sell FHP of Illinois.</title>
<headline>PacifiCare to sell FHP of Illinois.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc said Wednesday it signed a definitive agreement to sell its FHP of Illinois subsidiary to Principal Health Care Inc, a subsidiary of The Principal Financial Group.</p>
<p>The transaction, which was previously announced in June, is still subject to federal and state regulatory approvals and is expected to be finalized in the fall.</p>
